#: ../../news.rst:4
msgid "Release notes"
msgstr "发布说明"

#: ../../news.rst:14
msgid "ANet 0.3.9"
msgstr "ANet 0.3.9"

#: ../../news.rst:16
msgid ""
"ANet 0.3.9 is a patch release. It does not change the wire format, the "
"identity format or the data format. It consists of ``anet`` 0.3.9 and "
"ANetCore v0.16.2, which adds the new metadata key and reason codes to the"
" wire registry; ANetHub 0.3.3 and ANetLink v0.2.0 are unchanged. A 0.3.8 "
"node and a 0.3.9 node work together, and the hubs need no upgrade. Every "
"new setting is off by default. See :ref:`upgrading-039`."
msgstr ""
"ANet 0.3.9 是补丁版本，不改变线路格式、身份格式和数据格式。它由 ``anet`` 0.3.9 和 ANetCore v0.16.2 "
"组成，后者在线路注册表中加入了新的元数据键和原因码；ANetHub 0.3.3 和 ANetLink v0.2.0 保持不变。0.3.8 节点与 "
"0.3.9 节点可以协同工作，hub 无需升级。所有新设置默认关闭。参见 :ref:`upgrading-039`。"

#: ../../news.rst:23
msgid "An organisation runs inside an agent"
msgstr "组织运行在 agent 之中"

#: ../../news.rst:25
msgid ""
"A node can let an agent answer the text tasks of the members of a local "
"service, such as an organisation, with the rights of the member who sent "
"each task. The four settings are general and name no particular service. "
"See :ref:`howto-runner`."
msgstr ""
"节点可以让一个 agent "
"应答本地服务（例如一个组织）的成员发来的文本任务，并以发送各任务的成员的权限行事。以下四项设置均为通用设置，不针对任何特定服务。参见 :ref"
":`howto-runner`。"

#: ../../news.rst:29
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``inbound.admit`` asks a capability of the node's own service module, "
"marked ``\"internal\": true``, whether to admit a peer that is on no "
"list. Only the answer ``{\"admit\": true}`` admits; an error or no answer"
" within 5 seconds does not. Answers are cached per peer for "
"``cache_seconds`` (30 by default) and asked again at every turn; the deny"
" list always wins. An internal capability is never advertised and cannot "
"be called from the network. ``auto_reply.admitted`` (``off``, ``direct`` "
"or ``sandbox``) says how the exec backend serves an admitted peer. "
"Commands: ``anet inbound admit set``, ``anet inbound admit off`` and "
"``anet autoreply set --admitted``."
msgstr ""
"``inbound.admit`` 询问节点自身服务模块中一个标记为 ``\"internal\": true`` "
"的能力，是否准入不在任何名单上的对端。只有回答 ``{\"admit\": true}`` 才准入；出错或 5 秒内无回答均不准入。回答按对端缓存"
" ``cache_seconds`` 秒（默认 30），并在每一轮重新询问；deny "
"名单始终优先。内部能力从不公开，也无法从网络调用。``auto_reply.admitted``\\ （``off``、``direct`` 或 "
"``sandbox``）决定 exec 后端如何为已准入的对端提供服务。相关命令：``anet inbound admit "
"set``、``anet inbound admit off`` 和 ``anet autoreply set --admitted``。"

#: ../../news.rst:37
msgid ""
"``anet runner serve`` and ``auto_reply.runner`` run the agent of a direct"
" run as another Unix account, so that the agent cannot read the identity "
"keys, the control token or the data directory of the node. "
"``auto_reply.runner.max_jobs`` (4 by default) bounds the runs at once, "
"with one run at a time for each peer. Linux and macOS."
msgstr ""
"``anet runner serve`` 与 ``auto_reply.runner`` 以另一个 Unix 账户运行直接运行的 agent，使"
" agent 无法读取节点的身份密钥、控制令牌和数据目录。``auto_reply.runner.max_jobs``\\ （默认 "
"4）限制同时进行的运行数，每个对端同一时间只有一个运行。适用于 Linux 和 macOS。"

#: ../../news.rst:41
msgid ""
"``auto_reply.model_proxy`` keeps the keys of the model services with the "
"node: the agent holds a random key that is valid while its run lasts, and"
" the proxy adds the key of the upstream. Connections from other local "
"accounts are refused on Linux. ``auto_reply.admitted_budget`` bounds the "
"runs of admitted peers per day and per peer and the model requests of a "
"run; a run over the daily budget is refused before it starts."
msgstr ""
"``auto_reply.model_proxy`` 将模型服务的密钥保留在节点上：agent "
"只持有一个在其运行期间有效的随机密钥，上游的密钥由代理附加。在 Linux "
"上，来自其他本地账户的连接会被拒绝。``auto_reply.admitted_budget`` "
"限制已准入对端每天及每个对端的运行次数，以及单次运行的模型请求数；超出每日预算的运行在启动前即被拒绝。"

#: ../../news.rst:46
msgid ""
"``anet turn-mcp`` gives the agent of a trusted or admitted peer's run the"
" service capabilities marked ``\"agent_tool\": true``, always called as "
"that peer and marked ``X-ANet-Via: agent``."
msgstr ""
"``anet turn-mcp`` 向受信任或已准入对端的运行中的 agent 提供标记为 ``\"agent_tool\": true`` "
"的服务能力；这些能力始终以该对端的身份调用，并带有 ``X-ANet-Via: agent`` 标记。"

#: ../../news.rst:51
msgid "Removing ANet"
msgstr "移除 ANet"

#: ../../news.rst:53
msgid ""
"``anet uninstall`` stops the nodes and removes what the installers made: "
"the binary and its release record, the links to it, the marked ``PATH`` "
"blocks and, on Windows, the Run value and the ``PATH`` entry. Files that "
"are not the installed anet are kept, and so is ``~/.anet`` unless "
"``--delete-identity`` is given and confirmed on the terminal. See :ref"
":`intro-install-remove`."
msgstr ""
"``anet uninstall`` 停止各节点，并删除安装程序创建的内容：二进制文件及其发布记录、指向它的链接、带标记的 ``PATH`` "
"段落，以及 Windows 上的 Run 值和 ``PATH`` 条目。不属于已安装 anet 的文件会保留；``~/.anet`` "
"同样保留，除非指定 ``--delete-identity`` 并在终端上确认。参见 :ref:`intro-install-remove`。"

#: ../../news.rst:60 ../../news.rst:271
msgid "Download sources"
msgstr "下载源"

#: ../../news.rst:62
msgid ""
"``install.sh``, ``install.ps1`` and ``anet update`` skip a source whose "
"release manifest does not verify and try the next one; they fail only "
"when no source verifies. jsDelivr is read by version."
msgstr ""
"``install.sh``、``install.ps1`` 和 ``anet update`` "
"会跳过发布清单未通过验证的下载源并尝试下一个，只有在没有任何下载源通过验证时才失败。jsDelivr 按版本读取。"

#: ../../news.rst:67 ../../news.rst:176
msgid "Official agents"
msgstr "官方 agent"

#: ../../news.rst:69
msgid ""
"The official entry of the USTC organisation no longer lists ``ask``: "
"questions and tasks are sent to the organisation as text tasks, which its"
" agent answers."
msgstr "USTC 组织的官方条目不再列出 ``ask``：问题和任务以文本任务的形式发送给该组织，由其 agent 应答。"

#: ../../news.rst:76
msgid "ANet 0.3.8"
msgstr "ANet 0.3.8"

#: ../../news.rst:78
msgid ""
"ANet 0.3.8 is a patch release. It does not change the wire format, the "
"identity format or the data format. It consists of ``anet`` 0.3.8; "
"ANetCore v0.16.1, ANetHub 0.3.3 and ANetLink v0.2.0 are unchanged. A "
"0.3.7 node and a 0.3.8 node work together, and the hubs need no upgrade. "
"See :ref:`upgrading-038`."
msgstr ""
"ANet 0.3.8 是补丁版本，不改变线路格式、身份格式和数据格式。它由 ``anet`` 0.3.8 组成；ANetCore "
"v0.16.1、ANetHub 0.3.3 和 ANetLink v0.2.0 保持不变。0.3.7 节点与 0.3.8 节点可以协同工作，hub"
" 无需升级。参见 :ref:`upgrading-038`\\ 。"

#: ../../news.rst:84
msgid "The MCP server brings the node up"
msgstr "MCP 服务器自行启动节点"

#: ../../news.rst:86
msgid ""
"``anet mcp`` starts the node of the selected identity when no daemon "
"answers and the data directory is set up, exactly as ``anet up`` does, "
"and waits up to 20 seconds for it. The daemon runs in the home directory "
"of the user, not in the working directory of the session. See :ref"
":`howto-mcp-without-node`."
msgstr ""
"所选身份没有守护进程应答且数据目录已完成设置时，``anet mcp`` 完全按 ``anet up`` 的方式启动该身份的节点，并最多等待 20"
" 秒。守护进程在用户的主目录中运行，而不在会话的工作目录中运行。参见 :ref:`howto-mcp-without-node`。"

#: ../../news.rst:90
msgid ""
"When the node cannot run, ``anet mcp`` no longer exits with the status 1."
" It serves every tool; ``guide`` works, ``node_status`` answers "
"``running: false`` with the reason code, the sentence and the command "
"that fixes it, and the other tools answer with the same reason. The "
"server finds the node at the next call once it runs, without a new "
"session."
msgstr ""
"节点无法运行时，``anet mcp`` 不再以状态 1 退出，而是照常提供每个工具：``guide`` 正常工作，``node_status``"
" 返回 ``running: "
"false``，并附带原因代码、说明语句和修复命令，其他工具以同一原因返回。节点运行后，服务器在下一次调用时即可找到它，无需新会话。"

#: ../../news.rst:94
msgid ""
"``anet mcp`` does not create an identity in a data directory that has "
"none: it reports ``daemon_not_running`` with the new sentence key "
"``daemon_not_running.not_set_up`` and the command ``anet up`` (``anet "
"--id <name> up`` for a named identity)."
msgstr ""
"``anet mcp`` 不会在没有身份的数据目录中创建身份：它报告 ``daemon_not_running``，使用新的语句键 "
"``daemon_not_running.not_set_up``，并给出命令 ``anet up``\\ （具名身份为 ``anet --id "
"<name> up``）。"

#: ../../news.rst:97
msgid ""
"``anet mcp`` starts only the identities of the anet home of the user "
"(``~/.anet`` and ``~/.anet/ids/<name>``), and no node whose configuration"
" enables the ``shell`` module. A data directory that ``ANET_DATA_DIR`` or"
" ``ANET_HOME`` names elsewhere, and a node with the ``shell`` module, are"
" started with an explicit ``anet up`` (sentence keys "
"``daemon_not_running.outside_home`` and "
"``daemon_not_running.shell_enabled``)."
msgstr ""
"``anet mcp`` 只启动用户 anet 主目录中的身份（``~/.anet`` 与 "
"``~/.anet/ids/<name>``），也不启动配置中启用了 ``shell`` 模块的节点。``ANET_DATA_DIR`` 或 "
"``ANET_HOME`` 指向其他位置的数据目录，以及启用了 ``shell`` 模块的节点，需要明确运行 ``anet up`` 启动（语句键"
" ``daemon_not_running.outside_home`` 与 "
"``daemon_not_running.shell_enabled``）。"

#: ../../news.rst:102
msgid ""
"What ``anet mcp`` tells the model names no path and quotes no log of the "
"daemon; the data directory, the files of a refusal and the log appear "
"only in its error output (sentence keys ``daemon_not_running.mcp`` and "
"``daemon_not_answering.mcp``)."
msgstr ""
"``anet mcp`` 告诉模型的内容不包含任何路径，也不引用守护进程的日志；数据目录、拒绝所涉及的文件以及日志只出现在其错误输出中（语句键 "
"``daemon_not_running.mcp`` 与 ``daemon_not_answering.mcp``）。"

#: ../../news.rst:105
msgid ""
"The guide tells the agent to answer a question about anet itself from "
"``node_status`` and the tools, and to run ``anet up`` when "
"``node_status`` names it."
msgstr ""
"指南要求 Agent 依据 ``node_status`` 和各工具回答有关 anet 本身的问题，并在 ``node_status`` 给出 "
"``anet up`` 时运行该命令。"

#: ../../news.rst:109 ../../news.rst:148
msgid "Plugins for coding agents"
msgstr "编程 agent 的插件"

#: ../../news.rst:111
msgid ""
"The plugins move to version 0.3.0, their final version. Enabling a plugin"
" installs ANet when it is missing: the MCP launcher runs the official "
"installer, which checks the signed release manifest, installs ANet for "
"the user, starts the node and joins the public hub. The output of the "
"installer goes to the error output of the MCP server, one installation "
"runs at a time, and ``ANET_PLUGIN_NO_INSTALL=1`` turns the installation "
"off. See :ref:`agents-plugin-install`."
msgstr ""
"各插件升级到版本 0.3.0，即其最终版本。启用插件时，若 ANet 缺失，插件会安装它：MCP "
"启动脚本运行官方安装程序，该程序校验已签名的发布清单，为用户安装 ANet，启动节点并加入公共 hub。安装程序的输出写入 MCP "
"服务器的错误输出，同一时间只运行一次安装，``ANET_PLUGIN_NO_INSTALL=1`` 可关闭安装。参见 :ref:`agents-"
"plugin-install`。"

#: ../../news.rst:116
msgid ""
"The skills treat the installation of the plugin as the consent of the "
"user: when the anet tools are missing, the agent runs the setup without "
"asking, and it answers a question about anet from the state of the node."
msgstr "各技能把安装插件视为用户的同意：缺少 anet 工具时，Agent 不经询问即执行设置，并依据节点的状态回答有关 anet 的问题。"

#: ../../news.rst:119
msgid ""
"The POSIX scripts of the plugins keep only the absolute directories of "
"``PATH`` before they run their first program, so that a relative entry "
"such as ``.`` cannot run a program of the workspace. On Windows, the "
"runner asks Windows for the system directory of the PowerShell that runs "
"the installer. The lock of the installation names its holder by process "
"ID and start time, and on Windows it names the installer, which a host "
"that ends the MCP server does not end."
msgstr ""
"插件的 POSIX 脚本在运行第一个程序之前只保留 ``PATH`` 中的绝对路径目录，因此 ``.`` 之类的相对条目无法运行工作区中的程序。在"
" Windows 上，运行脚本向 Windows 查询用于运行安装程序的 PowerShell 所在的系统目录。安装锁以进程 ID "
"和启动时间标识其持有者；在 Windows 上，锁标识安装程序本身，宿主结束 MCP 服务器时不会结束该程序。"

#: ../../news.rst:128
msgid "ANet 0.3.7"
msgstr "ANet 0.3.7"

#: ../../news.rst:130
msgid ""
"ANet 0.3.7 is a patch release. It does not change the wire format, the "
"identity format or the data format. It consists of ``anet`` 0.3.7; "
"ANetCore v0.16.1, ANetHub 0.3.3 and ANetLink v0.2.0 are unchanged. A "
"0.3.6 node and a 0.3.7 node work together, and the hubs need no upgrade. "
"See :ref:`upgrading-037`."
msgstr ""
"ANet 0.3.7 是补丁版本，不改变线路格式、身份格式和数据格式。它由 ``anet`` 0.3.7 组成；ANetCore "
"v0.16.1、ANetHub 0.3.3 和 ANetLink v0.2.0 保持不变。0.3.6 节点与 0.3.7 节点可以协同工作，hub"
" 无需升级。参见 :ref:`upgrading-037`\\ 。"

#: ../../news.rst:136
msgid "The guide for coding agents"
msgstr "面向编程 agent 的指南"

#: ../../news.rst:138
msgid ""
"New command ``anet guide [<topic>] [--list]`` and new MCP tool ``guide``:"
" the guide of the installed release for coding agents, by topic "
"(``overview``, ``setup``, ``status``). The command needs no running node;"
" the tool makes no call to the daemon. The names, the parameter and the "
"three topics are permanent. See :doc:`reference/mcp-tools`."
msgstr ""
"新命令 ``anet guide [<topic>] [--list]`` 与新 MCP 工具 ``guide``\\ ：所装版本面向编程 "
"agent 的指南，按主题提供（\\ ``overview``\\ 、\\ ``setup``\\ 、\\ ``status``\\ "
"）。该命令不需要节点在运行，该工具不调用守护进程。名称、参数和这三个主题保持不变。参见 :doc:`reference/mcp-tools`\\ "
"。"

#: ../../news.rst:142
msgid ""
"The guide explains requests that a user addresses to the network by "
"writing ``@anet``: find the agent, prefer an official or verified card, "
"use its capability, and report the reply as another party's text."
msgstr "指南说明用户以 ``@anet`` 写给网络的请求：找到 agent，优先选择官方或已验证的名片，调用其能力，并把回复作为对方的文字转述。"

#: ../../news.rst:145
msgid "``anet mcp`` has 15 tools."
msgstr "``anet mcp`` 现有 15 个工具。"

#: ../../news.rst:150
msgid ""
"The plugins move to version 0.2.0. Each contains a launcher of ``anet "
"mcp``, a short skill that defers to the tool ``guide`` of the installed "
"anet, a ``/anet`` entry point where the host supports one, and the setup."
" They name no tools and no features, so later releases of anet need no "
"new plugin version. A plugin 0.2.0 needs anet 0.3.7 or later."
msgstr ""
"插件升级到 0.2.0。每个插件包含 ``anet mcp`` 的启动器、一段遵从本机 anet 的 ``guide`` "
"工具的简短技能、宿主支持时的 ``/anet`` 入口，以及设置流程。插件不列出任何工具或功能，因此 anet 之后的版本无需插件发布新版。插件 "
"0.2.0 需要 anet 0.3.7 或更高版本。"

#: ../../news.rst:154
msgid "The plugins run on Windows. See :doc:`agents/index`."
msgstr "插件可在 Windows 上运行。参见 :doc:`agents/index`\\ 。"

#: ../../news.rst:155
msgid ""
"The releases of the Gemini CLI extension carry ``win32.anet.tar.gz`` next"
" to the archives for Linux and macOS, so ``gemini extensions install`` "
"uses a release archive on Windows too."
msgstr ""
"Gemini CLI 扩展的发布在 Linux 与 macOS 归档之外提供 ``win32.anet.tar.gz``，``gemini "
"extensions install`` 在 Windows 上同样使用发布归档。"

#: ../../news.rst:159
msgid "Wiring Trae and ZCode"
msgstr "接入 Trae 与 ZCode"

#: ../../news.rst:161
msgid ""
"``anet agents wire trae`` registers the MCP server with Trae and Trae CN "
"and installs the short persona as a user rule. ``anet agents wire zcode``"
" installs the anet plugin through the ZCode command-line program; anet "
"writes nothing under ``~/.zcode``. See :doc:`agents/trae` and "
":doc:`agents/zcode`."
msgstr ""
"``anet agents wire trae`` 向 Trae 与 Trae CN 注册 MCP 服务器，并把简短说明安装为用户规则。\\ "
"``anet agents wire zcode`` 通过 ZCode 命令行程序安装 anet 插件；anet 不在 ``~/.zcode`` "
"下写入任何内容。参见 :doc:`agents/trae` 与 :doc:`agents/zcode`\\ 。"

#: ../../news.rst:167
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../news.rst:169
msgid ""
"``install.sh --controller AID`` installs the build with the ``shell`` "
"module and gives exactly this AID access to it, as ``install.ps1 "
"-Controller`` does. See :ref:`intro-install-options`."
msgstr ""
"``install.sh --controller AID`` 安装带 ``shell`` 模块的构建，并只向该 AID 开放访问，与 "
"``install.ps1 -Controller`` 相同。参见 :ref:`intro-install-options`\\ 。"

#: ../../news.rst:172
msgid ""
"``install.ps1 -Agents`` and ``-AgentList <list>`` run ``anet agents "
"wire`` after the installation, as ``install.sh --agents[=LIST]`` does."
msgstr ""
"``install.ps1 -Agents`` 与 ``-AgentList <list>`` 在安装后执行 ``anet agents "
"wire``\\ ，与 ``install.sh --agents[=LIST]`` 相同。"

#: ../../news.rst:178
msgid ""
"The official manifest of this release marks the organisation agent "
"``USTC`` on ``https://hub.agentnetwork.org.cn`` as official. The mark "
"grants no admission, trust or payment."
msgstr ""
"本版本的官方清单把 ``https://hub.agentnetwork.org.cn`` 上的组织 agent ``USTC`` "
"标记为官方。该标记不授予任何准入、信任或支付权限。"

#: ../../news.rst:186
msgid "ANet 0.3.6"
msgstr "ANet 0.3.6"

#: ../../news.rst:188
msgid ""
"ANet 0.3.6 is a patch release. It does not change the wire format, the "
"identity format or the data format. It consists of ``anet`` 0.3.6; "
"ANetCore v0.16.1, ANetHub 0.3.3 and ANetLink v0.2.0 are unchanged. A "
"0.3.5 node and a 0.3.6 node work together, and the hubs need no upgrade. "
"See :ref:`upgrading-036`."
msgstr ""
"ANet 0.3.6 是补丁版本，不改变线路格式、身份格式和数据格式。它仅包含 ``anet`` 0.3.6；ANetCore "
"v0.16.1、ANetHub 0.3.3 与 ANetLink v0.2.0 未变更。0.3.5 的节点与 0.3.6 的节点可协同工作，Hub"
" 无需升级。参见 :ref:`upgrading-036`。"

#: ../../news.rst:194 ../../news.rst:314
msgid "Windows installation"
msgstr "Windows 安装"

#: ../../news.rst:196
msgid ""
"``install.ps1`` downloads its release from the npm mirror "
"``registry.npmmirror.com`` or from the GitHub release of the project, "
"whichever answers first in a parallel probe of at most 4 seconds, then "
"from ``registry.npmjs.org``, jsDelivr and last the project's hosts. A "
"source that does not serve the release is passed over; a file that fails "
"a check ends the installation, whichever source served it. See :ref"
":`intro-install-windows-sources`."
msgstr ""
"``install.ps1`` 从 npm 镜像 ``registry.npmmirror.com`` 或本项目的 GitHub "
"发布下载其发布版本，取最多 4 秒的并行探测中先响应者，其后依次为 "
"``registry.npmjs.org``、jsDelivr，最后为本项目的主机。未提供该发布版本的下载源会被跳过；无论由哪个下载源提供，任一文件未通过检查即终止安装。参见"
" :ref:`intro-install-windows-sources`。"

#: ../../news.rst:201
msgid ""
"The output is a short summary: whether ANet is installed and running, the"
" AID of the node, the hub, the agent given remote control and the command"
" that revokes it, a takeover in one line, ``Note:`` lines only for what "
"is left to the user, and the path of the log of the run. The download is "
"shown as one line with a bar, the speed and the time remaining on an "
"interactive console. Everything else is written to "
"``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet\\logs\\install-<UTC time>.log``. See :ref:`intro-"
"install-windows-output`."
msgstr ""
"输出为简短的摘要：ANet 是否已安装并正在运行、节点的 "
"AID、hub、获得远程控制权限的代理及撤销命令、以一行说明的接管情况、仅在有需要用户处理的事项时出现的 ``Note:`` "
"行，以及本次运行的日志路径。在交互式控制台中，下载显示为一行，包含进度条、速度与剩余时间。其余全部内容写入 "
"``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet\\logs\\install-<UTC time>.log``。参见 :ref:`intro-"
"install-windows-output`。"

#: ../../news.rst:208
msgid ""
"Without ``-Controller``, the line also starts the node and joins the hub,"
" as ``install.sh`` does. The new parameter ``-NoStart`` installs without "
"starting the node."
msgstr ""
"不带 ``-Controller`` 时，该命令同样启动节点并加入 hub，与 ``install.sh`` 相同。新参数 "
"``-NoStart`` 只安装，不启动节点。"

#: ../../news.rst:210
msgid "``anet hub-register`` always runs with ``--passphrase-later``."
msgstr "``anet hub-register`` 始终以 ``--passphrase-later`` 运行。"

#: ../../news.rst:211
msgid ""
"A daemon of AgentNetwork 1.x that still holds the data directory is "
"stopped by the installer, through its local API and then by its process "
"ID, after its program has been checked. A data directory with a 0.3 "
"identity and a running 0.3 daemon is no longer reported as held by an "
"earlier release. See :ref:`intro-install-windows-earlier`."
msgstr ""
"仍占用数据目录的 AgentNetwork 1.x 守护进程由安装程序在检查其程序后停止，先通过其本地 API，再按进程 ID。含有 0.3 "
"身份且有 0.3 守护进程运行的数据目录不再被报告为被早期版本占用。参见 :ref:`intro-install-windows-"
"earlier`。"

#: ../../news.rst:217 ../../news.rst:355
msgid "Linux and macOS installation"
msgstr "Linux 与 macOS 安装"

#: ../../news.rst:219
msgid ""
"The installation is the single line ``curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 "
"-fsSL https://agentnetwork.org.cn/install.sh | sh``. By default the "
"installer verifies and installs ``anet`` in ``~/.local/bin``, takes over "
"earlier releases, runs ``anet init``, starts the node (``anet up``, with "
"a wait of at most 30 seconds until it answers; a running node is "
"restarted with the new binary), and joins "
"``https://hub.agentnetwork.org.cn`` with ``anet hub-register "
"--passphrase-later``, which asks nothing. A node that has already joined "
"a hub keeps it unless ``--hub`` names another. See :ref:`intro-install-"
"script`."
msgstr ""
"安装为单独一行命令 ``curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -fsSL "
"https://agentnetwork.org.cn/install.sh | sh``。默认情况下，安装脚本验证并将 ``anet`` 安装到"
" ``~/.local/bin``，接管较早版本，运行 ``anet init``，启动节点（``anet up``，最多等待 30 "
"秒直至其响应；正在运行的节点以新的二进制文件重启），并以不进行任何询问的 ``anet hub-register --passphrase-"
"later`` 加入 ``https://hub.agentnetwork.org.cn``。已加入 Hub 的节点保留该 Hub，除非 "
"``--hub`` 指定了另一个 Hub。参见 :ref:`intro-install-script`。"

#: ../../news.rst:227
msgid ""
"New options: ``--no-join`` starts the node without joining a hub, and "
"``--no-start`` neither starts nor joins. ``--hub`` and ``--name`` now "
"select the hub and the name of the default join."
msgstr ""
"新选项：``--no-join`` 启动节点但不加入 Hub，``--no-start`` 既不启动也不加入。``--hub`` 和 "
"``--name`` 现在指定默认加入所用的 Hub 和名称。"

#: ../../news.rst:230
msgid ""
"The output is one short line per phase (download, takeover, start), a "
"progress line while the download runs on a terminal, and a summary with "
"the AID, the hub state and a ``Note`` line for each step left to the "
"user. ``NO_COLOR`` removes the colour of the progress line. Everything "
"else is written to ``<data directory>/logs/install-<UTC time>.log`` (mode"
" ``0600``), which the last line names. A failure prints ``Error:``, "
"whether anything was changed, and the log. With ``ANET_LANG=zh``, the "
"lines are Chinese. See :ref:`intro-install-output`."
msgstr ""
"输出为每个阶段（下载、接管、启动）一行简短文字、在终端中下载时的一行进度，以及一段摘要，其中包含 AID、Hub "
"状态，并为每个留给用户的步骤给出一行 ``Note``。``NO_COLOR`` 取消进度行的颜色。其余内容均写入 "
"``<数据目录>/logs/install-<UTC 时间>.log``\\ （权限 ``0600``），最后一行给出其路径。失败时输出 "
"``Error:``、是否已更改任何内容，以及日志。设置 ``ANET_LANG=zh`` 时，各行以中文输出。参见 :ref:`intro-"
"install-output`。"

#: ../../news.rst:237
msgid ""
"The exit status is 3 when ``anet`` is installed but the node did not "
"start or the join failed. A join that the hub has accepted but not yet "
"confirmed is shown as ``(registering; it completes on its own)`` and is "
"not a failure. A download that stalls is abandoned for the next source."
msgstr ""
"``anet`` 已安装但节点未能启动或加入失败时，退出状态为 3。Hub 已接受但尚未确认的加入显示为 ``(registering; it "
"completes on its own)``，不视为失败。停滞的下载会被放弃，改用下一个下载源。"

#: ../../news.rst:241
msgid ""
"In a terminal, ``sudo`` asks for the password at most once, after one "
"line that gives the reason, when an earlier release can be removed only "
"by the superuser, when a system unit of AgentNetwork 1.x is to be "
"disabled, or when the command link ``/usr/local/bin/anet`` needs the "
"superuser. Declined, the installation continues, and a ``Note`` line "
"gives the command. Without a terminal, ``sudo`` is used only as ``sudo "
"-n``. ``--system`` is unchanged. See :ref:`intro-install-sudo`."
msgstr ""
"在终端中，当较早版本只能由超级用户删除、需要停用 AgentNetwork 1.x 的系统单元，或命令链接 "
"``/usr/local/bin/anet`` 需要超级用户权限时，``sudo`` "
"在一行说明原因之后最多询问一次密码。密码提示被拒绝时，安装继续进行，并以一行 ``Note`` 给出命令。没有终端时，``sudo`` 只以 "
"``sudo -n`` 的形式使用。``--system`` 保持不变。参见 :ref:`intro-install-sudo`。"

#: ../../news.rst:247
msgid ""
"When ``~/.local/bin`` is not on the search path of the shell that runs "
"the installer, the installer creates a command link ``anet`` to the new "
"binary in a terminal, so that ``anet`` runs at once. The link goes into "
"``~/bin``, ``/opt/homebrew/bin`` or ``/usr/local/bin``, the first that is"
" on the search path and writable without a password; otherwise into "
"``/usr/local/bin`` with ``sudo``. The binary stays in ``~/.local/bin``, "
"so ``anet update`` needs no administrator rights. See :ref:`intro-"
"install-path`."
msgstr ""
"当 ``~/.local/bin`` 不在运行安装脚本的 shell 的搜索路径中时，安装脚本在终端中创建指向新二进制文件的命令链接 "
"``anet``，使 ``anet`` 立即可用。链接放在 ``~/bin``、``/opt/homebrew/bin`` 或 "
"``/usr/local/bin`` 中第一个位于搜索路径且无需密码即可写入的目录；否则以 ``sudo`` 放在 "
"``/usr/local/bin``。二进制文件保留在 ``~/.local/bin`` 中，因此 ``anet update`` "
"无需管理员权限。参见 :ref:`intro-install-path`。"

#: ../../news.rst:253
msgid ""
"A daemon of AgentNetwork 1.x that still holds the data directory although"
" its binary is gone is stopped by the installer: through the shutdown "
"interface of 1.x on ``127.0.0.1:3998``, with the API token passed in a "
"private ``curl`` configuration file, and otherwise with ``SIGTERM`` to "
"the process of ``daemon.pid`` once its executable has been identified as "
"AgentNetwork 1.x. The manual ``mv`` step is no longer required. A daemon "
"of this release is never signalled."
msgstr ""
"二进制文件已不存在、但仍占用数据目录的 AgentNetwork 1.x 守护进程由安装脚本停止：通过 1.x 在 "
"``127.0.0.1:3998`` 上的关闭接口，API 令牌经私有的 ``curl`` 配置文件传递；否则在根据其可执行文件确认为 "
"AgentNetwork 1.x 之后，向 ``daemon.pid`` 所指进程发送 ``SIGTERM``。不再需要手动执行 "
"``mv``。本版本的守护进程绝不会收到信号。"

#: ../../news.rst:259
msgid ""
"A systemd unit ``anet-daemon`` whose ``ExecStart`` runs a binary of "
"AgentNetwork 1.x is disabled with ``systemctl --user disable --now anet-"
"daemon``, or for a system unit with ``sudo -n systemctl disable --now "
"anet-daemon``. Unit files are not deleted."
msgstr ""
"``ExecStart`` 运行 AgentNetwork 1.x 二进制文件的 systemd 单元 ``anet-daemon``，以 "
"``systemctl --user disable --now anet-daemon`` 停用，系统单元则以 ``sudo -n "
"systemctl disable --now anet-daemon`` 停用。单元文件不被删除。"

#: ../../news.rst:264 ../../news.rst:371 ../../news.rst:465
msgid "Command line"
msgstr "命令行"

#: ../../news.rst:266
msgid ""
"``anet`` without arguments prints a short guide: the version, the state "
"of the node, its AID and hub, the next step when one is due, and the "
"common commands. ``anet help --all`` lists every command."
msgstr ""
"不带参数的 ``anet`` 输出一份简短指引：版本、节点状态、AID 与 hub、需要时的下一步操作，以及常用命令。``anet help "
"--all`` 列出全部命令。"

#: ../../news.rst:273
msgid ""
"``install.sh`` and ``anet update`` use the same sources in the same "
"order. npmmirror, which serves the tarball of the npm package "
"``@agentnetwork/anet-<os>-<cpu>``, and GitHub Releases are asked at the "
"same time with a limit of three seconds and tried fastest first; then the"
" npm registry, jsDelivr, ``agentnetwork.org.cn`` and "
"``hub.agentnetwork.org.cn``. unpkg and the per-file route of npmmirror "
"are no longer used. See :ref:`intro-install-hosts`."
msgstr ""
"``install.sh`` 和 ``anet update`` 使用相同的下载源和相同的顺序。提供 npm 包 "
"``@agentnetwork/anet-<os>-<cpu>`` tarball 的 npmmirror 与 GitHub Releases "
"同时询问，时限为 3 秒，按响应速度从快到慢尝试；其后为 npm 注册表、jsDelivr、``agentnetwork.org.cn`` 和 "
"``hub.agentnetwork.org.cn``。不再使用 unpkg 以及 npmmirror 的逐文件路径。参见 :ref"
":`intro-install-hosts`。"

#: ../../news.rst:278
msgid ""
"A source whose release is older than the installer, or than the installed"
" ``anet``, is passed over while another source serves the current "
"release. A source that serves the installed version no longer hides a "
"newer release from ``anet update``."
msgstr ""
"所提供的发布早于安装脚本或已安装的 ``anet`` 的下载源，只要另有下载源提供当前发布，即被跳过。提供已安装版本的下载源不再对 ``anet "
"update`` 掩盖更新的版本。"

#: ../../news.rst:281
msgid ""
"Redirects are followed by the installer itself, over ``https://`` only "
"and to the hosts of the source."
msgstr "重定向由安装脚本自行跟随，仅限 ``https://``，且仅限该下载源的主机。"

#: ../../news.rst:283
msgid ""
"``--base URL`` and ``ANET_INSTALL_BASE`` replace every source, for ``anet"
" update`` too; ``ANET_INSTALL_BASE`` is no longer tried before the "
"default sources."
msgstr ""
"``--base URL`` 和 ``ANET_INSTALL_BASE`` 取代全部下载源，对 ``anet update`` "
"同样适用；``ANET_INSTALL_BASE`` 不再在默认下载源之前尝试。"

#: ../../news.rst:285
msgid ""
"``anet update`` reads an npm tarball with bounded sizes, uses only "
"regular files under ``package/dl/``, refuses entry names that are "
"absolute or contain ``..``, and checks the sha512 ``integrity`` of the "
"package metadata when present. Its output names the source."
msgstr ""
"``anet update`` 以有界大小读取 npm tarball，仅使用 ``package/dl/`` 下的普通文件，拒绝绝对路径或含 "
"``..`` 的条目名称，并在包元数据提供 sha512 ``integrity`` 时予以核对。其输出给出所用的下载源。"

#: ../../news.rst:290 ../../news.rst:379
msgid "Continuous integration"
msgstr "持续集成"

#: ../../news.rst:292
msgid ""
"The job ``unix-upgrade`` runs ``install.sh`` with ``--no-join`` over a "
"real installation of AgentNetwork 1.1.15, and checks the length of the "
"output, the summary, the takeover lines, and the mode and content of the "
"log."
msgstr ""
"作业 ``unix-upgrade`` 在 AgentNetwork 1.1.15 的真实安装之上以 ``--no-join`` 运行 "
"``install.sh``，并检查输出的行数、摘要、接管行，以及日志的权限和内容。"

#: ../../news.rst:295
msgid ""
"A test runs ``install.sh`` end to end, piped to ``sh`` in a temporary "
"home directory, against a release signed for the test and served by local"
" stand-ins for the download sources; it contacts no hub."
msgstr ""
"一项测试在临时主目录中以管道方式将 ``install.sh`` 交给 ``sh`` "
"端到端运行，所用发布为测试签名，由本地替身充当各下载源；该测试不连接任何 Hub。"

#: ../../news.rst:298
msgid ""
"On Windows, ``test-install-http.ps1`` downloads a published release "
"through the real GitHub and npmmirror routes with the functions of "
"``install.ps1`` and checks it against ``checksums.txt``, in Windows "
"PowerShell 5.1 and PowerShell 7."
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 上，``test-install-http.ps1`` 使用 ``install.ps1`` 的函数，经由真实的 GitHub"
" 与 npmmirror 路径下载一个已发布的版本，并与 ``checksums.txt`` 核对，在 Windows PowerShell "
"5.1 与 PowerShell 7 中分别运行。"

#: ../../news.rst:306
msgid "ANet 0.3.5"
msgstr "ANet 0.3.5"

#: ../../news.rst:308
msgid ""
"ANet 0.3.5 is a patch release. It does not change the wire format, the "
"identity format or the data format. It consists of ``anet`` 0.3.5; "
"ANetCore v0.16.1, ANetHub 0.3.3 and ANetLink v0.2.0 are unchanged. A "
"0.3.4 node and a 0.3.5 node work together, and the hubs need no upgrade. "
"See :ref:`upgrading-035`."
msgstr ""
"ANet 0.3.5 是补丁版本，不改变线路格式、身份格式和数据格式。它仅包含 ``anet`` 0.3.5；ANetCore "
"v0.16.1、ANetHub 0.3.3 与 ANetLink v0.2.0 未变更。0.3.4 的节点与 0.3.5 的节点可协同工作，Hub"
" 无需升级。参见 :ref:`upgrading-035`。"

#: ../../news.rst:316
msgid ""
"The installation is started with one line that is identical in "
"``cmd.exe``, Windows PowerShell 5.1, PowerShell 7, ``bash`` and ``zsh`` "
"in WSL 1 and WSL 2, and Git Bash: ``powershell.exe -NoProfile "
"-NonInteractive -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -Command \"...\"``. The "
"controller form ends with ``-Controller CONTROLLER_AID``; the installer "
"refuses the unchanged placeholder. Run in WSL, the line installs the "
"Windows build on the Windows host. See :ref:`intro-install-windows`."
msgstr ""
"安装只需一行命令，该命令在 ``cmd.exe``、Windows PowerShell 5.1、PowerShell 7、WSL 1 与 WSL"
" 2 中的 ``bash`` 和 ``zsh`` 以及 Git Bash 中完全相同：``powershell.exe -NoProfile "
"-NonInteractive -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -Command \"...\"``。控制方形式以 "
"``-Controller CONTROLLER_AID`` 结尾；安装程序拒绝未替换的占位符。在 WSL 中运行时，该命令在 Windows "
"主机上安装 Windows 版本。参见 :ref:`intro-install-windows`。"

#: ../../news.rst:322
msgid ""
"The installer asks nothing and reads nothing from the console. "
"``-Controller`` on the command line is the consent to the grant; the "
"console confirmation of 0.3.4 is removed. At the end, the installer "
"prints what was granted and how to revoke it. The installation completes "
"without a console, as in the tool call of an agent, a CI job or WSL."
msgstr ""
"安装程序不进行任何询问，也不从控制台读取任何内容。命令行中的 ``-Controller`` 即为对授权的同意；0.3.4 "
"中的控制台确认已移除。安装结束时，安装程序列出所授予的权限及其撤销方法。在没有控制台的环境中（如代理的工具调用、CI 作业或 "
"WSL）安装同样可以完成。"

#: ../../news.rst:326
msgid "The exit status of ``powershell.exe`` is the result of the installation."
msgstr "``powershell.exe`` 的退出状态即为安装结果。"

#: ../../news.rst:327
msgid ""
"An elevated window is no longer refused, and ``-Elevated`` has no effect."
" ANet is installed for the current account. While Windows provides a "
"standard user token (User Account Control on), no program of the account "
"is run from the elevated window, and the node is started only with "
"standard user rights, through a one-time Task Scheduler task; when that "
"fails, the node starts at the next logon instead, and the installation "
"ends with exit status 3 and the commands to run in a normal window. An "
"elevated window of another account than the one logged on is refused. "
"Without a standard token, the node runs with the rights of the window, "
"which the installer states."
msgstr ""
"不再拒绝提升权限的窗口，``-Elevated`` 不产生任何作用。ANet 为当前账户安装。当 Windows "
"提供标准用户令牌时（用户账户控制已开启），不从提升权限的窗口运行该账户的任何程序，节点仅通过一次性的任务计划程序任务以标准用户权限启动；若启动失败，节点改为在下次登录时启动，安装以退出状态"
" 3 "
"结束，并输出应在普通窗口中运行的命令。以登录账户之外的账户提升权限的窗口会被拒绝。没有标准令牌时，节点以窗口的权限运行，安装程序会说明这一情况。"

#: ../../news.rst:335
msgid ""
"Without ``-Prefix``, the installer chooses the install directory: an "
"existing installation, ``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\anet``, "
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\bin`` or ``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet-bin``, the first "
"that passes the checks. It reports each skipped directory with the reason"
" and names the accounts concerned."
msgstr ""
"未指定 ``-Prefix`` "
"时，由安装程序选择安装目录：现有安装的目录、``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\anet``、``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\bin``"
" 或 ``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet-bin``，取第一个通过检查的目录。每个被跳过的目录均附原因报告，并写明相关账户的名称。"

#: ../../news.rst:339
msgid ""
"The privacy check ignores an access control entry that grants another "
"account no more than synchronization, traversal and reading attributes, "
"such as the entry of an app container capability on the profile "
"directory. Every other grant still fails the check."
msgstr "私有性检查忽略仅向其他账户授予同步、遍历与读取属性权限的访问控制项，例如用户配置文件目录上应用容器功能的访问控制项。其他任何授权仍不能通过检查。"

#: ../../news.rst:342
msgid ""
"The installer takes over from earlier installations: an ANet of the 1.x "
"npm package, recognized by the module path in its binary, is stopped with"
" its own ``stop`` command, the installer waits for its daemon to exit, "
"its data in ``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet`` is moved aside by the rule of the "
"daemon and ``install.sh`` without being deleted (also when no earlier "
"installation was found, once no daemon holds it), and only then is its "
"npm package removed; when the data cannot be moved, the installation "
"stops before ``anet init`` with exit status 3 and the remaining commands."
" Another installation of 0.3 or later is taken off the user's ``PATH`` "
"when its directory holds nothing else. The install directory is put first"
" on the user's ``PATH``, and the installer confirms with a new "
"``powershell.exe`` which ``anet`` runs."
msgstr ""
"安装程序接管较早的安装：1.x npm 包的 ANet（按其二进制文件中的模块路径识别）以其自身的 ``stop`` "
"命令停止，安装程序等待其守护进程退出，其位于 ``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet`` 的数据按守护进程与 ``install.sh`` "
"的规则移至别处而不删除（未找到较早的安装时亦然，只要没有守护进程占用该数据），此后才卸载其 npm 包；数据无法移动时，安装在 ``anet "
"init`` 之前停止，退出状态为 3，并输出剩余命令。其他 0.3 或更高版本的安装，仅当其目录不含其他内容时才从用户的 ``PATH`` "
"中移除。安装目录置于用户 ``PATH`` 的首位，安装程序通过一个新的 ``powershell.exe`` 确认实际运行的 ``anet``。"

#: ../../news.rst:352
msgid ""
"The new parameter ``-NoJoin`` starts the node without registering with a "
"hub."
msgstr "新参数 ``-NoJoin`` 启动节点但不注册到 hub。"

#: ../../news.rst:357
msgid ""
"``install.sh`` replaces AgentNetwork 1.x, anet 0.1 and anet 0.2 in the "
"same run and without input. It stops the earlier daemon with that "
"release's own ``stop`` command, removes the npm package "
"``@agentnetwork/anet`` 1.x with npm, replaces earlier ``anet`` binaries "
"with a link to the new binary, and renames the earlier data directory to "
"``~/.anet-legacy-<version>-<UTC time>``. Nothing is deleted. See :ref"
":`upgrading-installer`."
msgstr ""
"``install.sh`` 在同一次运行中替换 AgentNetwork 1.x、anet 0.1 与 anet "
"0.2，不要求任何输入。安装脚本用早期版本自身的 ``stop`` 命令停止其守护进程，用 npm 删除 npm 包 "
"``@agentnetwork/anet`` 1.x，将早期的 ``anet`` 二进制文件替换为指向新二进制文件的链接，并将早期的数据目录改名为"
" ``~/.anet-legacy-<版本>-<UTC 时间>``。不删除任何内容。参见 :ref:`upgrading-installer`。"

#: ../../news.rst:362
msgid ""
"The installer puts the install directory first on the search path of new "
"shells through a marked block in the shell profiles, and confirms with a "
"new login shell that ``anet`` is the new binary. ``--no-modify-path`` "
"leaves the profiles unchanged."
msgstr ""
"安装脚本通过 shell 配置文件中一段带标记的内容，把安装目录放在新 shell 搜索路径的最前，并用新的登录 shell 确认 "
"``anet`` 即新的二进制文件。``--no-modify-path`` 不修改配置文件。"

#: ../../news.rst:365
msgid ""
"``sudo`` is used only as ``sudo -n``; a step that needs a password is "
"reported with the exact command. ``install.sh --system`` no longer "
"prompts; run ``sudo -v`` first."
msgstr ""
"``sudo`` 只以 ``sudo -n`` 的形式使用；需要密码的步骤不会执行，报告给出确切的命令。``install.sh "
"--system`` 不再询问密码，请先运行 ``sudo -v``。"

#: ../../news.rst:367
msgid ""
"The daemon refuses to start in a data directory of AgentNetwork 1.x "
"without a 0.3 identity, with ``identity_v02``."
msgstr "守护进程拒绝在没有 0.3 身份的 AgentNetwork 1.x 数据目录中启动，报告 ``identity_v02``。"

#: ../../news.rst:373
msgid ""
"``anet init --shell-controller <AID> --yes`` writes the controller grant "
"without a confirmation; the command line is the confirmation. Without "
"``--yes``, the grant is confirmed on the terminal as before, and a "
"process without a terminal is refused with ``tty_required``."
msgstr ""
"``anet init --shell-controller <AID> --yes`` 无需确认即写入控制方授权，命令行即为确认。不带 "
"``--yes`` 时，与以往相同，在终端上确认授权；没有终端的进程以 ``tty_required`` 拒绝。"

#: ../../news.rst:381
msgid ""
"A job on ``windows-latest`` runs ``install.ps1`` end to end with the "
"published command from ``cmd.exe``, Windows PowerShell 5.1, PowerShell 7 "
"and Git Bash, against a release of the commit that is signed with a key "
"made for the job, and takes over a planted earlier installation. It "
"contacts no hub."
msgstr ""
"``windows-latest`` 上的一个作业以发布的命令，分别从 ``cmd.exe``、Windows PowerShell "
"5.1、PowerShell 7 与 Git Bash 端到端运行 "
"``install.ps1``，安装以该作业生成的密钥签名的当前提交的发布版本，并接管预先放置的较早安装。该作业不连接任何 hub。"

#: ../../news.rst:385
msgid ""
"A job on macOS and Ubuntu runs ``install.sh`` of the commit, piped to "
"``sh``, over a real installation of the npm package "
"``@agentnetwork/anet`` 1.1.15 with its daemon running, and checks the "
"takeover and the ``anet`` that a new login shell runs."
msgstr ""
"macOS 与 Ubuntu 上的一个作业，针对一个守护进程正在运行的 npm 包 ``@agentnetwork/anet`` 1.1.15 "
"真实安装，以管道方式将当前提交的 ``install.sh`` 交给 ``sh`` 运行，并检查接管结果以及新的登录 shell 运行的 "
"``anet``。"

#: ../../news.rst:393
msgid "ANet 0.3.4"
msgstr "ANet 0.3.4"

#: ../../news.rst:395
msgid ""
"ANet 0.3.4 is a patch release. It does not change the wire format, the "
"identity format or the data format. It consists of ``anet`` 0.3.4; "
"ANetCore v0.16.1, ANetHub 0.3.3 and ANetLink v0.2.0 are unchanged. A "
"0.3.3 node and a 0.3.4 node work together, and the hubs need no upgrade. "
"See :ref:`upgrading-034`."
msgstr ""
"ANet 0.3.4 是补丁版本，不改变线路格式、身份格式和数据格式。它仅包含 ``anet`` 0.3.4；ANetCore "
"v0.16.1、ANetHub 0.3.3 与 ANetLink v0.2.0 未变更。0.3.3 的节点与 0.3.4 的节点可协同工作，Hub"
" 无需升级。参见 :ref:`upgrading-034`。"

#: ../../news.rst:401
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

#: ../../news.rst:403
msgid ""
"``anet`` runs natively on Windows 10 version 1809 or later and on Windows"
" Server 2019 or later, on amd64 and arm64, in the default build and in "
"the build with the ``shell`` module. WSL2 is not required. See :ref"
":`intro-install-windows`."
msgstr ""
"``anet`` 原生运行于 Windows 10 1809 或更高版本以及 Windows Server 2019 或更高版本，支持 amd64"
" 与 arm64，包括缺省版本和含 ``shell`` 模块的版本。无需 WSL2。参见 :ref:`intro-install-"
"windows`。"

#: ../../news.rst:406
msgid ""
"The PowerShell script ``install.ps1`` installs ``anet`` with Windows "
"PowerShell 5.1 or PowerShell 7 and no other tool. The script is signed "
"(``install.ps1.sig``) and carries the SHA-256 digests of the four Windows"
" builds. A downloaded binary must match its digest, and then verifies the"
" signed release manifest itself, before anything is installed. The "
"installer refuses an elevated window unless ``-Elevated`` is given, "
"checks that the installation directory is private to the user, adds it to"
" the user's ``PATH`` and starts the node at logon through the ``Run`` "
"value of the user. With ``-Controller <AID>`` it installs the build with "
"the ``shell`` module, gives exactly that AID access to it after one "
"confirmation on the console, and joins "
"``https://hub.agentnetwork.org.cn`` unless ``-Hub`` is given."
msgstr ""
"PowerShell 脚本 ``install.ps1`` 仅借助 Windows PowerShell 5.1 或 PowerShell 7 "
"安装 ``anet``，不依赖其他工具。该脚本带有签名（``install.ps1.sig``），并载有四个 Windows 版本的 "
"SHA-256 "
"摘要。下载的二进制文件须与其摘要一致，随后由其自身校验已签名的发布清单，之后才会安装任何内容。安装程序拒绝在提升权限的窗口中运行，除非指定 "
"``-Elevated``；它检查安装目录仅对该用户私有，将该目录加入用户的 ``PATH``，并通过该用户的 ``Run`` "
"值在登录时启动节点。指定 ``-Controller <AID>`` 时，它安装含 ``shell`` 模块的版本，在控制台上确认一次后仅向该 "
"AID 开放此模块，并加入 ``https://hub.agentnetwork.org.cn``\\ （指定 ``-Hub`` 时除外）。"

#: ../../news.rst:416
msgid ""
"The daemon keeps its data in ``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet`` and its runtime "
"files in ``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\run``. Private files and directories "
"carry an access control list that admits only the user, ``SYSTEM`` and "
"``Administrators``. Secrets are private from the moment they are created,"
" and files are opened without following reparse points. ``anet up`` "
"starts the daemon detached from the console; it runs as the logged-on "
"user and never as a Windows service."
msgstr ""
"守护进程的数据保存在 ``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet``，运行时文件保存在 "
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\run``。私有文件和目录带有仅允许该用户、``SYSTEM`` 与 "
"``Administrators`` 访问的访问控制列表。机密文件自创建之时起即为私有，打开文件时不跟随重解析点。``anet up`` "
"使守护进程脱离控制台启动；它以已登录用户的身份运行，从不作为 Windows 服务运行。"

#: ../../news.rst:422
msgid ""
"The ``shell`` module runs commands with Windows PowerShell by default; "
"``pwsh``, ``cmd`` and the absolute path of a supported interpreter can be"
" configured. A command runs as a process tree in a job object and ends as"
" a whole. An argument that contains one of the characters ``\" % ! ^ & | "
"< > ( )``, a carriage return or a line feed is refused, because a batch "
"file would interpret it again. See :ref:`the shell module on Windows "
"<topics-shell-windows>`."
msgstr ""
"``shell`` 模块缺省使用 Windows PowerShell 执行命令；可配置 ``pwsh``、``cmd`` "
"或受支持解释器的绝对路径。命令作为作业对象中的进程树运行，并整体结束。包含字符 ``\" % ! ^ & | < > ( "
")``、回车或换行的参数将被拒绝，因为批处理文件会再次解释这些字符。参见 :ref:`Windows 上的 shell 模块 <topics-"
"shell-windows>`。"

#: ../../news.rst:427
msgid ""
"``anet update`` replaces a running ``anet.exe`` by renaming it aside, "
"puts it back when a later step fails, and removes the copies that were "
"moved aside on a later run."
msgstr ""
"``anet update`` 通过将正在运行的 ``anet.exe`` "
"改名移开来替换它，后续步骤失败时将其恢复，并在之后的运行中删除已移开的副本。"

#: ../../news.rst:429
msgid ""
"``anet pull`` marks received files as downloaded from the Internet "
"(``Zone.Identifier``) and adds the suffix ``.txt`` to names on which "
"Explorer acts, such as ``.lnk``, ``.url``, ``.scf`` and ``desktop.ini``."
msgstr ""
"``anet pull`` 将接收的文件标记为从 Internet "
"下载（``Zone.Identifier``），并为资源管理器会对其执行操作的文件名添加后缀 ``.txt``，例如 "
"``.lnk``、``.url``、``.scf`` 与 ``desktop.ini``。"

#: ../../news.rst:432
msgid ""
"Auto-reply has no sandbox on Windows and refuses every run that needs "
"one. It also refuses an agent program that is a batch file."
msgstr "自动回复在 Windows 上没有沙箱，拒绝所有需要沙箱的运行；它同样拒绝作为批处理文件的智能体程序。"

#: ../../news.rst:434
msgid ""
"Backends on a Unix socket, TCP backends on the same host, the ``p2p`` "
"module and the ANetLink sockets are refused with a reason, because the "
"node cannot identify the process at the far end. Backends on another host"
" over HTTPS work."
msgstr ""
"Unix 套接字上的后端、同一主机上的 TCP 后端、``p2p`` 模块和 ANetLink "
"套接字均以明确原因被拒绝，因为节点无法确认对端进程。通过 HTTPS 访问其他主机上的后端不受影响。"

#: ../../news.rst:437
msgid ""
"The installation, shell, sandbox and security pages, the READMEs and "
"``SECURITY.md`` describe the Windows build in English and Chinese. Its "
"limits are listed in :ref:`the known limitations of the Windows build "
"<reference-known-limitations-windows>`."
msgstr ""
"安装、shell、沙箱与安全页面、各 README 以及 ``SECURITY.md`` 以中英文描述 Windows 版本。其限制列于 "
":ref:`Windows 版本的已知限制 <reference-known-limitations-windows>`。"

#: ../../news.rst:442
msgid "Distribution"
msgstr "分发"

#: ../../news.rst:444
msgid ""
"Each release is published on npm. ``@agentnetwork/anet`` is a launcher "
"for Node.js 18 or later. Before the first run of a version it verifies "
"the signature of the release manifest and the SHA-256 digests of the "
"archive and of the binary, and it runs the binary from the cache "
"directory of the user. The builds are in the packages "
"``@agentnetwork/anet-<os>-<cpu>`` and ``@agentnetwork/anet-"
"shell-<os>-<cpu>``, with ``win32`` for Windows. See :ref:`intro-install-"
"npm`."
msgstr ""
"每个版本均发布到 npm。``@agentnetwork/anet`` 是适用于 Node.js 18 "
"或更高版本的启动器。在某一版本首次运行之前，它校验发布清单的签名以及归档与二进制文件的 SHA-256 "
"摘要，并从用户的缓存目录运行该二进制文件。各版本的构建位于 ``@agentnetwork/anet-<os>-<cpu>`` 与 "
"``@agentnetwork/anet-shell-<os>-<cpu>`` 包中，Windows 对应 ``win32``。参见 :ref"
":`intro-install-npm`。"

#: ../../news.rst:450
msgid ""
"``install.sh`` and ``anet update`` try the npm package of the build "
"through npmmirror, jsDelivr and unpkg after the project hosts. Every file"
" is checked against the signed manifest, whichever host serves it. See "
":ref:`intro-install-hosts`."
msgstr ""
"``install.sh`` 与 ``anet update`` 在项目主机之后，通过 npmmirror、jsDelivr 与 unpkg "
"尝试该构建的 npm 包。无论由哪台主机提供，每个文件都按已签名的清单进行校验。参见 :ref:`intro-install-hosts`。"

#: ../../news.rst:453
msgid ""
"The ``anet`` plugin is generated from one source for Claude Code, OpenAI "
"Codex, Cursor, CodeBuddy, opencode, DeepSeek Harness, Trae, Google "
"Antigravity, Gemini CLI and ZCode. The catalogues and archives are served"
" below ``https://agentnetwork.org.cn/plugins/`` and "
"``https://agentnetwork.org.cn/zcode/``. Antigravity and Gemini CLI "
"install from the mirror repository ``ANetResearch/anet-plugins``, and "
"opencode installs ``@agentnetwork/opencode-anet`` from the npm registry. "
"New guides describe CodeBuddy, DeepSeek Harness, Trae, Antigravity, "
"Gemini CLI and ZCode (see :ref:`agents-index`)."
msgstr ""
"``anet`` 插件由同一来源为 Claude Code、OpenAI "
"Codex、Cursor、CodeBuddy、opencode、DeepSeek Harness、Trae、Google "
"Antigravity、Gemini CLI 与 ZCode 生成。目录与归档由 "
"``https://agentnetwork.org.cn/plugins/`` 与 "
"``https://agentnetwork.org.cn/zcode/`` 提供。Antigravity 与 Gemini CLI 从镜像仓库 "
"``ANetResearch/anet-plugins`` 安装，opencode 从 npm 仓库安装 ``@agentnetwork"
"/opencode-anet``。新增的指南介绍 CodeBuddy、DeepSeek "
"Harness、Trae、Antigravity、Gemini CLI 与 ZCode（参见 :ref:`agents-index`）。"

#: ../../news.rst:460
msgid ""
"Plugin version 0.1.3 states that ``anet`` runs on Windows. The launchers "
"of the plugins are POSIX shell scripts and run on Linux and macOS only; "
"on Windows, ``anet agents wire`` registers the node."
msgstr ""
"插件 0.1.3 版说明 ``anet`` 可在 Windows 上运行。插件的启动脚本为 POSIX shell 脚本，仅在 Linux 与 "
"macOS 上运行；在 Windows 上，由 ``anet agents wire`` 注册节点。"

#: ../../news.rst:467
msgid ""
"``anet init --shell-controller <AID>`` makes the AID the only caller of "
"the ``shell`` module and adds it to ``peers.allow``, after one "
"confirmation on the terminal and while no daemon runs. It requires the "
"build with the ``shell`` module."
msgstr ""
"``anet init --shell-controller <AID>`` 使该 AID 成为 ``shell`` 模块唯一的调用方，并将其加入"
" ``peers.allow``；需在终端上确认一次，且须在没有守护进程运行时执行。该命令需要含 ``shell`` 模块的版本。"

#: ../../news.rst:470
msgid ""
"``anet hub-register <url> --passphrase-later`` joins a hub without asking"
" for the recovery passphrase. The passphrase is set afterwards with "
"``anet identity protect``. The option is not combined with ``--recovery-"
"file`` or ``--new-recovery``."
msgstr ""
"``anet hub-register <url> --passphrase-later`` 加入 Hub 时不询问恢复口令，口令之后通过 "
"``anet identity protect`` 设置。该选项不能与 ``--recovery-file`` 或 ``--new-"
"recovery`` 同时使用。"

#: ../../news.rst:473
msgid ""
"``anet update --verify-dir <dir>`` fetches and writes nothing. It "
"verifies the release manifest in the directory with the release key that "
"is compiled into the binary, and checks that the running binary is the "
"build of that release for its variant and platform: its SHA-256 digest, "
"its size, its version and its modules. With ``--installed <version>``, a "
"release older than that version is refused. ``install.ps1`` uses the "
"command to check the binary that it is about to install."
msgstr ""
"``anet update --verify-dir <dir>`` "
"不下载也不写入任何内容。它使用编译进二进制文件的发布密钥校验该目录中的发布清单，并核对正在运行的二进制文件是否为该版本针对其变体与平台的构建：SHA-256"
" 摘要、大小、版本和模块。指定 ``--installed <version>`` 时，早于该版本的发布将被拒绝。``install.ps1`` "
"使用该命令核对即将安装的二进制文件。"

#: ../../news.rst:481 ../../news.rst:543
msgid "Fixes"
msgstr "修复"

#: ../../news.rst:483
msgid ""
"``anet doctor`` reports the recovery file under ``identity.recovery`` "
"only when another account can read it. A recovery file with mode ``0400``"
" is no longer reported."
msgstr ""
"``anet doctor`` 仅在恢复文件可被其他账户读取时才在 ``identity.recovery`` 下报告该文件。权限为 "
"``0400`` 的恢复文件不再被报告。"

#: ../../news.rst:485
msgid ""
"The sentence of ``identity.recovery_perm`` names the command of the "
"platform that makes the recovery file private: ``chmod 600`` on Linux and"
" macOS, an ``icacls`` command on Windows. The code is unchanged."
msgstr ""
"``identity.recovery_perm`` 的语句给出本平台使恢复文件变为私有的命令：在 Linux 与 macOS 上为 "
"``chmod 600``，在 Windows 上为一条 ``icacls`` 命令。代码不变。"

#: ../../news.rst:488
msgid ""
"Apart from these two points, the download hosts of ``anet update`` and "
"sentences that now also name the Windows command, the behaviour on Linux "
"and macOS does not change."
msgstr "除上述两点、``anet update`` 的下载主机以及现在同时给出 Windows 命令的语句之外，Linux 与 macOS 上的行为不变。"

#: ../../news.rst:495
msgid "ANet 0.3.3"
msgstr "ANet 0.3.3"

#: ../../news.rst:497
msgid ""
"ANet 0.3.3 is a patch release. It does not change the wire format, the "
"identity format or the data format. It consists of ``anet`` 0.3.3, "
"ANetHub 0.3.3 and ANetCore v0.16.1; ANetLink v0.2.0 is unchanged. ANetHub"
" skips the number 0.3.2, so that the versions of ``anet`` and ANetHub are"
" equal again. ANetCore v0.16.1 adds the 22 ``wire_`` codes to its wire "
"registry and changes no behaviour. A 0.3.2 node and a 0.3.3 node work "
"together; the hubs are upgraded in place and keep their data."
msgstr ""
"ANet 0.3.3 是补丁版本，不改变线路格式、身份格式和数据格式。它由 ``anet`` 0.3.3、ANetHub 0.3.3 和 "
"ANetCore v0.16.1 组成；ANetLink v0.2.0 未变更。ANetHub 跳过版本号 0.3.2，使 ``anet`` 与 "
"ANetHub 的版本再次一致。ANetCore v0.16.1 将 22 个 ``wire_`` "
"代码加入其线路注册表，不改变任何行为。0.3.2 的节点与 0.3.3 的节点可协同工作；Hub 原地升级并保留其数据。"

#: ../../news.rst:505
msgid "Reason codes"
msgstr "原因码"

#: ../../news.rst:507
msgid ""
"Reason codes are now managed as a stable interface. The register "
"``internal/a2ashape/codes.txt`` lists every code that ``anet`` has "
"published, with the version that first emitted it, and a test holds it "
"against the reason table. The rules are on the page :doc:`reference"
"/reason-codes`, in the section :ref:`reason-codes-lifecycle`: the meaning"
" of a code never changes, and a code is never renamed or reused. The hub "
"has the same register for its own codes."
msgstr ""
"原因码现在作为稳定接口管理。登记表 ``internal/a2ashape/codes.txt`` 列出 ``anet`` "
"发布过的每一个码及其首次出现的版本，并由测试与原因表对照。规则见 :doc:`reference/reason-codes` 的 :ref"
":`reason-codes-lifecycle` 一节：代码的含义不会改变，代码不会被改名或复用。hub 对自己的代码有同样的登记表。"

#: ../../news.rst:513
msgid ""
"The tables of :doc:`reference/reason-codes` and of :ref:`hub-api-codes` "
"have a *Since* column, every code has an anchor, and a table lists the "
"retired codes. No code is retired in this release."
msgstr ""
":doc:`reference/reason-codes` 和 :ref:`hub-api-codes` 的表格增加了 *Since* "
"列，每个代码都有锚点，并有一张表列出已停用的代码。本版本没有停用任何代码。"

#: ../../news.rst:516
msgid ""
"The command line and the MCP tools show the code after the sentence of a "
"refusal, for example ``... send it again in 2 minutes. [busy]``. A "
"refusal that the hub returned with a code of its own shows "
"``[hub_refused:<hub code>]``. The JSON output is unchanged."
msgstr ""
"命令行和 MCP 工具在拒绝语句之后显示代码，例如 ``... send it again in 2 minutes. [busy]``。hub "
"以自己的代码拒绝时显示 ``[hub_refused:<hub code>]``。JSON 输出不变。"

#: ../../news.rst:519
msgid ""
"The commands ``anet agents wire``, ``anet agents unwire`` and ``anet "
"agents`` add 22 codes with the prefix ``wire_``, for example "
"``wire_json_invalid`` and ``wire_conflict``."
msgstr ""
"命令 ``anet agents wire``、``anet agents unwire`` 和 ``anet agents`` 增加了 22 "
"个以 ``wire_`` 为前缀的代码，例如 ``wire_json_invalid`` 和 ``wire_conflict``。"

#: ../../news.rst:524
msgid "Language"
msgstr "语言"

#: ../../news.rst:526
msgid ""
"English is the default language of every sentence that ``anet`` and "
"``anet-hub`` print and of every text that is handed to a model. Chinese "
"is an opt-in: it is selected only when ``ANET_LANG`` begins with ``zh``. "
"``LC_ALL``, ``LC_MESSAGES`` and ``LANG`` are no longer consulted. See "
":ref:`upgrading-033`."
msgstr ""
"``anet`` 和 ``anet-hub`` 输出的每一条语句，以及交给模型的每一段文本，默认均为英文。中文需要显式启用：仅当 "
"``ANET_LANG`` 以 ``zh`` 开头时选用中文。``LC_ALL``、``LC_MESSAGES`` 与 ``LANG`` "
"不再被读取。见 :ref:`upgrading-033`。"

#: ../../news.rst:530
msgid ""
"The prompt of the exec backend, the self-check prompt of auto-reply and "
"the audit verdict are English in both languages. The administration "
"interface of the hub answers in English."
msgstr "exec 后端的提示词、自动回复的自检提示词和审计结论在两种语言下均为英文。Hub 的管理接口以英文应答。"

#: ../../news.rst:534
msgid "Agent integration"
msgstr "智能体集成"

#: ../../news.rst:536
msgid ""
"The output of ``anet agents``, ``anet agents wire`` and ``anet agents "
"unwire`` comes from the reason table, in English by default and in "
"Chinese under ``ANET_LANG=zh-CN``. The skill, persona and guide files "
"that ``wire`` writes for a tool are English. The exit statuses are "
"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"``anet agents``、``anet agents wire`` 和 ``anet agents unwire`` "
"的输出取自原因表，默认为英文，在 ``ANET_LANG=zh-CN`` 下为中文。``wire`` "
"为工具写入的技能、人设和指引文件均为英文。退出状态不变。"

#: ../../news.rst:539
msgid ""
"``anet agents unwire`` no longer prints an entry to add by hand when it "
"cannot parse a JSON file; it names the file and leaves it unchanged."
msgstr "``anet agents unwire`` 在无法解析某个 JSON 文件时，不再输出需手动加入的条目，而是指明该文件并保持其不变。"

#: ../../news.rst:545
msgid ""
"The task event stream no longer sends a preview frame twice when the "
"frame arrives while the stream starts."
msgstr "任务事件流在启动期间收到预览帧时，不再将同一帧发送两次。"

#: ../../news.rst:552
msgid "ANet 0.3.2"
msgstr "ANet 0.3.2"

#: ../../news.rst:554
msgid ""
"ANet 0.3.2 is a patch release. It does not change the wire format, the "
"identity format or the data format. It consists of ``anet`` 0.3.2; "
"ANetCore v0.16.0, ANetHub 0.3.1 and ANetLink v0.2.0 are unchanged. A "
"0.3.1 node and a 0.3.2 node work together, and the hubs need no upgrade."
msgstr ""
"ANet 0.3.2 是补丁版本，不改变线路格式、身份格式和数据格式。它仅包含 ``anet`` 0.3.2；ANetCore "
"v0.16.0、ANetHub 0.3.1 与 ANetLink v0.2.0 未变更。0.3.1 的节点与 0.3.2 的节点可协同工作，Hub"
" 无需升级。"

#: ../../news.rst:560
msgid "Integration guides"
msgstr "接入指南"

#: ../../news.rst:562
msgid ""
"A new section, :ref:`agents-index`, describes how to connect AI tools to "
"``anet``. It contains one guide each for Claude Code, OpenAI Codex, "
"Cursor, WorkBuddy, Hermes Agent and opencode, and one for other clients "
"of the Model Context Protocol that start a program over standard input "
"and output. Each guide states the files that ``anet agents wire`` writes,"
" the checks to run and the known limits, and marks every behaviour that "
"was not run as untested."
msgstr ""
"新增章节 :ref:`agents-index`，说明如何将 AI 工具接入 ``anet``。其中包含 Claude Code、OpenAI "
"Codex、Cursor、WorkBuddy、Hermes Agent 与 opencode "
"各一份指南，以及一份面向通过标准输入输出启动程序的其他模型上下文协议（MCP）客户端的指南。每份指南说明 ``anet agents wire``"
" 写入的文件、应执行的检查和已知限制，并将未实际运行的行为标注为未经测试。"

#: ../../news.rst:568
msgid ""
"The index page carries a support matrix. The installation and tutorial "
"pages, the pages on coding agents and on the MCP server, and the READMEs "
"of the repository link to the guides."
msgstr "索引页给出支持矩阵。安装与教程页面、编程智能体页面、MCP 服务器页面以及仓库的 README 均链接到这些指南。"

#: ../../news.rst:573 ../../news.rst:635
msgid "Node behaviour"
msgstr "节点行为"

#: ../../news.rst:575
msgid ""
"``anet agents wire workbuddy`` and ``anet agents unwire workbuddy`` "
"connect and disconnect WorkBuddy. The command writes the ``anet`` entry "
"to ``~/.workbuddy/mcp.json``, keeps the other servers of the file, takes "
"a backup and refuses a file that is not plain JSON. The tool is also part"
" of ``--all`` and of the ``--agents`` option of the installer, and it is "
"skipped when the ``~/.workbuddy`` directory does not exist."
msgstr ""
"``anet agents wire workbuddy`` 与 ``anet agents unwire workbuddy`` 用于接入和断开"
" WorkBuddy。该命令将 ``anet`` 条目写入 "
"``~/.workbuddy/mcp.json``，保留文件中的其他服务器，先做备份，并拒绝处理不是纯 JSON 的文件。该工具同时纳入 "
"``--all`` 与安装器的 ``--agents`` 选项；``~/.workbuddy`` 目录不存在时跳过。"

#: ../../news.rst:581
msgid ""
"``anet agents wire codex`` prints a note when ``AGENTS.override.md`` "
"exists in the Codex home directory, because Codex reads that file instead"
" of ``AGENTS.md``. The override file is not edited."
msgstr ""
"Codex 主目录中存在 ``AGENTS.override.md`` 时，``anet agents wire codex`` 输出提示，因为 "
"Codex 会读取该文件而不是 ``AGENTS.md``。该覆盖文件不会被修改。"

#: ../../news.rst:584
msgid ""
"``anet agents wire hermes`` names the tools of the guide block with the "
"prefix ``mcp_anet_``, and with ``--a2a`` it prints the command that makes"
" ``a2a_call`` visible in Hermes Agent."
msgstr ""
"``anet agents wire hermes`` 在指引块中以前缀 ``mcp_anet_`` 命名工具；使用 ``--a2a`` "
"时，输出使 ``a2a_call`` 在 Hermes Agent 中可见的命令。"

#: ../../news.rst:587
msgid ""
"The check for a missing MCP server in ``anet doctor`` follows "
"``XDG_CONFIG_HOME`` and the file ``opencode.jsonc`` of opencode."
msgstr ""
"``anet doctor`` 对缺失 MCP 服务器的检查遵循 ``XDG_CONFIG_HOME``，并识别 opencode 的 "
"``opencode.jsonc`` 文件。"

#: ../../news.rst:589
msgid "The tutorial extracts the identifier from ``anet status --json``."
msgstr "教程从 ``anet status --json`` 中提取标识符。"

#: ../../news.rst:592 ../../news.rst:829
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "文档"

#: ../../news.rst:594
msgid ""
"The pages on installation, the command line and the frequently asked "
"questions list WorkBuddy. They state that Windows is not supported, and "
"that WSL2 is untested."
msgstr "安装、命令行与常见问题页面列出 WorkBuddy，并说明不支持 Windows，WSL2 未经测试。"

#: ../../news.rst:596
msgid ""
"The table of timeouts on the MCP page names the timeout settings of "
"Gemini CLI and Trae."
msgstr "MCP 页面的超时表列出 Gemini CLI 与 Trae 的超时设置。"

#: ../../news.rst:602
msgid "ANet 0.3.1"
msgstr "ANet 0.3.1"

#: ../../news.rst:604
msgid ""
"ANet 0.3.1 is a patch release. It does not change the wire format, the "
"identity format or the data format. It consists of ``anet`` 0.3.1 and "
"ANetHub 0.3.1; ANetCore v0.16.0 and ANetLink v0.2.0 are unchanged. A "
"0.3.0 node and a 0.3.1 hub work together, and the reverse."
msgstr ""
"ANet 0.3.1 是补丁版本，不改变线路格式、身份格式和数据格式。它由 ``anet`` 0.3.1 与 ANetHub 0.3.1 "
"组成；ANetCore v0.16.0 与 ANetLink v0.2.0 未变更。0.3.0 的节点可与 0.3.1 的 Hub "
"协同工作，反之亦然。"

#: ../../news.rst:610
msgid "macOS sandbox"
msgstr "macOS 沙箱"

#: ../../news.rst:612
msgid ""
"The Seatbelt sandbox is enabled on macOS. In 0.3.0 its self-check aborted"
" on macOS 14 and macOS 15, because a program started under the profile "
"reads the root directory itself and the profile did not permit that "
"single read; the dynamic loader ended the process. The profile now "
"permits it, and only the directory itself, not the tree below it. The "
"profile remains closed by default and opens only the minimum of reads, "
"writes and network access."
msgstr ""
"macOS 上的 Seatbelt 沙箱已启用。在 0.3.0 中，其自检在 macOS 14 与 macOS 15 上中止：在该 profile"
" 下启动的程序会读取根目录本身，而 profile 未允许这一次读取，动态加载器因此结束了进程。现在 profile "
"允许该读取，且仅限目录本身，不包括其下的目录树。profile 仍然默认拒绝，只开放最小限度的读、写和网络访问。"

#: ../../news.rst:618
msgid ""
"Tasks of untrusted peers, and all tasks when ``trusted`` is ``sandbox``, "
"now run in the sandbox on macOS. The file isolation, the egress endpoint "
"with its key and the denial of the keychain are verified on macOS 14 and "
"macOS 15 in continuous integration, where a skipped test counts as a "
"failure."
msgstr ""
"不受信任对端的任务，以及 ``trusted`` 为 ``sandbox`` 时的所有任务，现在在 macOS "
"上于沙箱中运行。文件隔离、带密钥的出口端点以及对钥匙串的拒绝，已在持续集成中于 macOS 14 与 macOS 15 "
"上验证，被跳过的测试视为失败。"

#: ../../news.rst:622
msgid ""
"The ``claude`` agent keeps its scratch files in the temporary directory "
"of the run."
msgstr "``claude`` Agent 将其临时文件保存在本次运行的临时目录中。"

#: ../../news.rst:625
msgid "Federation and directory"
msgstr "联邦与目录"

#: ../../news.rst:627
msgid ""
"A first lookup of a recipient that joined another hub shortly before no "
"longer fails with ``recipient_unknown``. An empty answer from the cache "
"of the hub is followed by one query that bypasses the cache; hubs that do"
" not know the header ignore it."
msgstr ""
"对不久前加入另一个 Hub 的接收方进行首次查找时，不再以 ``recipient_unknown`` 失败。Hub "
"缓存给出空答复后，随即进行一次绕过缓存的查询；不识别该请求头的 Hub 会忽略它。"

#: ../../news.rst:630
msgid ""
"A receipt of a payment that another hub signed for its own ledger is "
"verified under the key history of that hub. A receipt whose signer is "
"unknown or does not match is refused."
msgstr "另一个 Hub 为其自身账本签发的支付回执，按该 Hub 的密钥历史验证。签发方未知或不匹配的回执将被拒绝。"

#: ../../news.rst:637
msgid ""
"The wait between attempts to join a hub grows to one minute at most. "
"While a node waits for admission, the hub line of ``anet status`` states "
"when the next attempt is made."
msgstr "加入 Hub 的两次尝试之间的等待时间最长增长到一分钟。节点等待准入期间，``anet status`` 的 Hub 行会标明下一次尝试的时间。"

#: ../../news.rst:639
msgid "``anet status`` no longer reports a deactivated identity as registered."
msgstr "``anet status`` 不再将已停用的身份报告为已注册。"

#: ../../news.rst:640
msgid ""
"The local A2A interface waits, for up to five minutes, for its recorded "
"port when only an outgoing connection holds it, and then starts on that "
"port."
msgstr "当其记录的端口仅被某个出站连接占用时，本地 A2A 接口最多等待五分钟，随后在该端口上启动。"

#: ../../news.rst:642
msgid ""
"``--max-auto-replies`` and ``--poll-interval`` are refused with "
"``cli_removed`` and the replacement sentence, instead of ``unknown "
"flag``."
msgstr ""
"``--max-auto-replies`` 与 ``--poll-interval`` 现以 ``cli_removed`` "
"及替代说明被拒绝，而不再提示 ``unknown flag``。"

#: ../../news.rst:644
msgid ""
"The help text of ``anet agents wire`` lists only the tools that the "
"command supports."
msgstr "``anet agents wire`` 的帮助文本只列出该命令支持的工具。"

#: ../../news.rst:645
msgid ""
"The sentences of the reason table name the node or the hub instead of "
"addressing the reader. The Chinese module sentences separate the Latin "
"module name from the noun."
msgstr "原因表中的语句改为以节点或 Hub 为主语，不再称呼读者。中文模块语句在拉丁文模块名与名词之间加入空格。"

#: ../../news.rst:649
msgid "ANetHub"
msgstr "ANetHub"

#: ../../news.rst:651
msgid ""
"``anet-hub admission`` sets the admission mode before the first start "
"(``--init``)."
msgstr "``anet-hub admission`` 可在首次启动之前设置准入模式（``--init``）。"

#: ../../news.rst:652
msgid "The hub applies the cross-hub lookup change described above."
msgstr "Hub 应用上文所述的跨 Hub 查找变更。"

#: ../../news.rst:655
msgid "Documentation and verification"
msgstr "文档与验证"

#: ../../news.rst:657
msgid ""
"The upgrade guide states that ``auto_reply.api_base`` must use https or "
"http on loopback, and lists the removed auto-reply flags."
msgstr "升级指南说明 ``auto_reply.api_base`` 必须使用 https 或回环地址上的 http，并列出已移除的自动回复参数。"

#: ../../news.rst:659
msgid ""
"The scenario, fleet and joint-shell test runs follow the 0.3 flow and "
"gate the continuous integration. The module tests that 0.3.0 held back "
"run by default."
msgstr "场景、集群和联合 shell 测试按 0.3 流程运行，并作为持续集成的阻塞项。0.3.0 中暂缓的模块测试现默认运行。"

#: ../../news.rst:665
msgid "ANet 0.3.0"
msgstr "ANet 0.3.0"

#: ../../news.rst:667
msgid ""
"ANet 0.3.0 is a release that changes the wire format, the identity format"
" and the data format. It consists of ANetCore v0.16.0, ``anet`` 0.3.0, "
"ANetHub 0.3.0 and ANetLink 0.2.0. Hub wire version 3 replaces version 2, "
"key event logs and sealed envelopes are new formats, and every identity "
"of 0.2 is replaced by a new one. A 0.3 node works only with 0.3 hubs. The"
" upgrade is a fresh deployment, described in :doc:`upgrading`."
msgstr ""
"ANet 0.3.0 变更了线路格式、身份格式和数据格式，由 ANetCore v0.16.0、\\ ``anet`` 0.3.0、ANetHub"
" 0.3.0 和 ANetLink 0.2.0 组成。Hub 线路版本 3 取代版本 2，密钥事件日志与封缄信封为新格式，0.2 "
"的所有身份均由新身份取代。0.3 节点只能与 0.3 的 Hub 协同工作。升级方式为全新部署，详见 :doc:`upgrading`\\ 。"

#: ../../news.rst:675
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "概要"

#: ../../news.rst:677
msgid ""
"The hub learns less. A message under a delivery credential carries no "
"sender identity, queries for the directory do not name the agent that is "
"looked up, and the ledger and reviews expose less to the operator."
msgstr "Hub 获知的信息更少。使用送达凭据的消息不携带发送方身份，目录查询不指明被查找的 Agent，账本和评价向运维者暴露的内容也更少。"

#: ../../news.rst:680
msgid ""
"The sender learns more. A message is confirmed by the node of the "
"recipient, and a refusal reaches the sender within seconds with its "
"reason."
msgstr "发送方获知的信息更多。消息由接收方节点确认，拒绝会在数秒内连同原因送达发送方。"

#: ../../news.rst:682
msgid ""
"Keys are replaced by the day. Ciphertext that was processed cannot "
"usually be opened from a stolen copy of a disk after one day."
msgstr "密钥按日更换。已处理的密文在一天之后通常无法再借助被盗磁盘的副本打开。"

#: ../../news.rst:684
msgid ""
"Identities can be recovered. Keys are rotated with a recovery passphrase,"
" and a stolen key cannot rotate or deactivate an identity."
msgstr "身份可以恢复。密钥轮换需要恢复口令，被盗的密钥无法轮换或停用身份。"

#: ../../news.rst:686
msgid ""
"Local execution is isolated. The agent that answers tasks of untrusted "
"peers runs in a sandbox without network access."
msgstr "本地执行相互隔离。应答不受信任对端任务的 Agent 在无网络访问的沙箱中运行。"

#: ../../news.rst:688
msgid ""
"Prices are not public. They are signed in an extended card and handed to "
"the caller."
msgstr "价格不公开。价格签名后置于扩展卡片中，交给调用方。"

#: ../../news.rst:689
msgid ""
"Every user-visible sentence comes from one table with a reason code, and "
"the command line, MCP and the local A2A interface give the same sentence "
"for the same event."
msgstr "所有面向用户的语句均来自同一张带原因码的表，命令行、MCP 和本地 A2A 接口对同一事件给出相同的语句。"

#: ../../news.rst:693
msgid "Compatibility"
msgstr "兼容性"

#: ../../news.rst:695
msgid ""
"Hub wire 3. A 0.2 daemon and a 0.3 hub, and a 0.3 daemon and a 0.2 hub, "
"refuse each other with ``wire_too_old`` and ``wire_too_new``."
msgstr ""
"Hub 线路版本 3。0.2 守护进程与 0.3 Hub 之间，以及 0.3 守护进程与 0.2 Hub 之间，会分别以 "
"``wire_too_old`` 和 ``wire_too_new`` 相互拒绝。"

#: ../../news.rst:697
msgid ""
"Sealed envelope version 2, key event log ``anet.kel/2``, identity file "
"``anet.identity/2``, direct frames ``v: 3``, C1 version 1 between "
"``anet`` and ANetLink. There is no decoding path for the earlier formats."
msgstr ""
"封缄信封版本 2，密钥事件日志 ``anet.kel/2``，身份文件 ``anet.identity/2``，直连帧 ``v: "
"3``，``anet`` 与 ANetLink 之间为 C1 版本 1。早期格式没有解码路径。"

#: ../../news.rst:700
msgid ""
"Data directories are not migrated. A 0.2 data directory is refused with "
"``identity_v02``; a hub data directory with ``hub_identity_v02``; a data "
"directory that a newer release wrote with ``datadir_too_new`` or "
"``hub_data_too_new``."
msgstr ""
"数据目录不会被迁移。0.2 的数据目录以 ``identity_v02`` 拒绝，Hub 的 0.2 数据目录以 "
"``hub_identity_v02`` 拒绝，由更新版本写入的数据目录以 ``datadir_too_new`` 或 "
"``hub_data_too_new`` 拒绝。"

#: ../../news.rst:703
msgid ""
"A removed key in ``config.json`` stops the daemon "
"(``config_key_removed``)."
msgstr "``config.json`` 中已移除的键会使守护进程停止（``config_key_removed``）。"

#: ../../news.rst:704
msgid ""
"Identities are created again. Allow lists, reviews and the credit balance"
" of a 0.2 hub do not carry over."
msgstr "身份需重新创建。0.2 Hub 上的允许列表、评价和额度余额不会延续。"

#: ../../news.rst:708
msgid "Messaging and privacy"
msgstr "消息与隐私"

#: ../../news.rst:710
msgid "Delivery credentials"
msgstr "送达凭据"

#: ../../news.rst:711
msgid ""
"A first contact is made under a session that the sender opens at the hub."
" Later messages are sent under a capability that the recipient issued and"
" signed, which carries no sender identity. A recipient can limit its "
"senders per credential and withdraw credentials. See :ref:`topics-"
"messaging`."
msgstr ""
"首次联系在发送方于 Hub "
"开立的会话下进行。此后的消息在接收方签发并签名的能力凭据下发送，凭据不携带发送方身份。接收方可按凭据限制发送方，也可撤销凭据。参见 :ref"
":`topics-messaging`\\ 。"

#: ../../news.rst:716
msgid "Directory queries"
msgstr "目录查询"

#: ../../news.rst:717
msgid ""
"The directory is queried by bucket of at most 10 bits of the hash of the "
"AID. The routes that took an AID in the request are removed."
msgstr "目录按 AID 哈希的桶查询，桶最多 10 位。请求中携带 AID 的路由已被移除。"

#: ../../news.rst:720
msgid "Delivery confirmation"
msgstr "送达确认"

#: ../../news.rst:721
msgid ""
"The node of the recipient confirms each final decision. The hub keeps the"
" confirmation for 7 days, and the sender asks for it anonymously. "
"Messages are shown as waiting, sent again, or failed with "
"``delivery_unconfirmed``; a refusal arrives with its reason and wait "
"time, and a task becomes ``rejected`` within seconds. Cancels of tasks "
"that are not known yet are kept as tombstones."
msgstr ""
"接收方的节点确认每一项最终决定。Hub 将确认保留 7 天，发送方以匿名方式请求确认。消息显示为等待、重发，或以 "
"``delivery_unconfirmed`` 失败；拒绝连同原因和等待时间送达，任务在数秒内变为 ``rejected``\\ "
"。针对尚未知晓的任务的取消请求以墓碑形式保留。"

#: ../../news.rst:727
msgid "Forward secrecy and retention"
msgstr "前向保密与保留期"

#: ../../news.rst:728
msgid ""
"Encryption keys are valid for one UTC day, published 14 days ahead, and "
"deleted after the day. A second layer under an interaction key protects "
"the messages of a task. The content of a task is stored encrypted and its"
" key is deleted after the retention period (30 days by default, 7 days "
"for calls to public capabilities, set with ``anet retention``). The node "
"detects a rollback of its local state."
msgstr ""
"加密密钥在一个 UTC 日内有效，提前 14 "
"天发布，当日过后删除。交互密钥之下的第二层加密保护任务的消息。任务内容加密存储，其密钥在保留期后删除（默认 30 天，对公开能力的调用为 7 "
"天，由 ``anet retention`` 设置）。节点能够检测其本地状态的回滚。"

#: ../../news.rst:734
msgid "Previews"
msgstr "预览"

#: ../../news.rst:735
msgid ""
"A provider can send a snapshot of the reply that it is writing, every 5 "
"to 10 seconds (``anet preview``). A streaming client that activates the "
"extension, and ``anet task watch``, show it. MCP does not show previews."
msgstr ""
"提供方可每隔 5 至 10 秒发送其正在撰写的回复的快照（``anet preview``）。启用该扩展的流式客户端以及 ``anet task "
"watch`` 会显示预览，MCP 不显示预览。"

#: ../../news.rst:739
msgid "Capability calls with files"
msgstr "携带文件的能力调用"

#: ../../news.rst:740
msgid ""
"A call of a public capability can carry files, and a capability declares "
"the count, size and types that it takes."
msgstr "对公开能力的调用可以携带文件，能力声明其接受的文件数量、大小和类型。"

#: ../../news.rst:744
msgid "Identity"
msgstr "身份"

#: ../../news.rst:746
msgid ""
"Key event log version 2 with the events ``icp``, ``rot`` and ``dip``. "
"Every rotation commits to the next key. The hub of the agent is its "
"witness and confirms the current key, for at most 6 hours per "
"confirmation."
msgstr ""
"密钥事件日志版本 2，包含事件 ``icp``\\ 、\\ ``rot`` 和 ``dip``\\ 。每次轮换都承诺下一个密钥。Agent 所在的"
" Hub 是其见证，负责确认当前密钥，每次确认最长 6 小时。"

#: ../../news.rst:749
msgid ""
"The recovery passphrase protects a recovery file. Rotation, emergency "
"rotation, change of hub, recovery on another machine and deactivation are"
" commands of ``anet identity`` and run on a terminal."
msgstr "恢复口令保护恢复文件。轮换、紧急轮换、更换 Hub、在另一台机器上恢复以及停用，均为 ``anet identity`` 的命令，在终端上执行。"

#: ../../news.rst:752
msgid ""
"An agent can complete the first join without a terminal. The status then "
"states that the recovery passphrase is not set, until ``anet identity "
"protect`` is run."
msgstr "Agent 无需终端即可完成首次加入。此时状态会指出恢复口令尚未设置，直到运行 ``anet identity protect``\\ 。"

#: ../../news.rst:754
msgid ""
"A hub has an identity with the same commands (``anet-hub identity``), and"
" can rotate its own keys."
msgstr "Hub 拥有身份，使用相同的命令（``anet-hub identity``），并可轮换自身的密钥。"

#: ../../news.rst:758
msgid "Hubs and payments"
msgstr "Hub 与支付"

#: ../../news.rst:760
msgid ""
"Admission by AID. ``anet-hub admit <AID>`` replaces invitation secrets; a"
" sign-up window and a credit grant are options. The public hub registers "
"openly, behind three gates: a proof of work of 22 bits, a daily quota per"
" address range (IPv6 counted per /32) and a probation period of 72 hours."
" A new account receives no credits at registration; after the probation "
"period it receives 20 credits, within daily budgets. A join that waits "
"for admission completes in the background."
msgstr ""
"按 AID 准入。\\ ``anet-hub admit <AID>`` 取代邀请密钥，注册窗口和额度赠送为可选项。公共 Hub "
"开放注册，设有三道关口：22 位的工作量证明、按地址段计的每日配额（IPv6 按 /32 计）以及 72 "
"小时的试用期。新账号在注册时不获得额度，试用期结束后获得 20 额度，受每日预算限制。等待准入的加入操作在后台完成。"

#: ../../news.rst:766
msgid ""
"The ledger shows 14 days of detail. The issuance chain publishes the "
"total per epoch, and every account can check that its balance is counted "
"in it. The daemon checks every 6 hours."
msgstr "账本显示 14 天的明细。发放链公布每个纪元的总量，每个账号都可以核查其余额已计入其中。守护进程每 6 小时检查一次。"

#: ../../news.rst:768
msgid ""
"Reviews have pairs of pseudonyms and counts, dates without time of day, "
"and no edges in ``/graph``."
msgstr "评价以化名对和计数的形式给出，日期不含具体时刻，``/graph`` 中不再有边。"

#: ../../news.rst:770
msgid "Settlement across hubs is forwarded with an authenticated signature."
msgstr "跨 Hub 结算以经认证的签名转发。"

#: ../../news.rst:771
msgid ""
"The hub gateway for plain HTTP x402, voucher redemption and "
"``publish_prices`` are removed. Prices are in the extended card that the "
"provider signs. ``anet card <aid>`` and the MCP tool ``get_agent_card`` "
"show them. A quote above the signed price is not paid automatically."
msgstr ""
"用于普通 HTTP x402 的 Hub 网关、凭证兑换和 ``publish_prices`` "
"已被移除。价格位于提供方签名的扩展卡片中，``anet card <aid>`` 和 MCP 工具 ``get_agent_card`` "
"可显示价格。高于签名价格的报价不会被自动支付。"

#: ../../news.rst:774
msgid ""
"Spending is shown. A payment sentence states the quote, the limit and the"
" result."
msgstr "支出可见。支付语句会说明报价、限额和结果。"

#: ../../news.rst:777
msgid "Local execution"
msgstr "本地执行"

#: ../../news.rst:779
msgid ""
"Tasks of untrusted peers run in a sandbox without network (Linux with "
"bubblewrap and seccomp). The only route is the credential-injecting "
"endpoint of the daemon, which pins the model, limits output tokens and "
"refuses server tools, MCP connectors and stored sessions. The sandboxed "
"agent does not receive the API key. On macOS the Seatbelt sandbox is not "
"part of 0.3.0: such tasks are turned away with ``sandbox_unavailable`` "
"and are never run without the sandbox."
msgstr ""
"不受信任对端的任务在无网络的沙箱中运行（Linux 使用 bubblewrap 和 "
"seccomp）。唯一的通路是守护进程注入凭据的端点，该端点固定模型、限制输出令牌，并拒绝服务端工具、MCP 连接器和已存储的会话。沙箱中的 "
"Agent 不会获得 API 密钥。在 macOS 上，Seatbelt 沙箱不属于 0.3.0：此类任务会以 "
"``sandbox_unavailable`` 拒绝，且绝不会在沙箱之外运行。"

#: ../../news.rst:785
msgid ""
"An optional list of hosts (``sandbox.egress_allow``) permits CONNECT "
"connections with exact host names. Every listed host is an outbound "
"channel."
msgstr "可选的主机列表（``sandbox.egress_allow``）允许使用精确主机名的 CONNECT 连接。列出的每个主机都是一条出站通道。"

#: ../../news.rst:787
msgid "Budgets limit the runs for untrusted peers per day and per peer."
msgstr "预算按日和按对端限制针对不受信任对端的运行次数。"

#: ../../news.rst:788
msgid ""
"Keys, conversations and tickets are not passed on command lines. Unix-"
"socket backends are checked for the user of the listening process."
msgstr "密钥、对话和票据不经命令行传递。对 Unix 套接字后端，会检查监听进程的用户。"

#: ../../news.rst:792
msgid "Modules"
msgstr "模块"

#: ../../news.rst:794
msgid ""
"Optional parts of the daemon are modules with their own build tags and "
"settings. A module can be switched off with ``without`` in "
"``config.json`` or ``anet init --without``. A module that is not present "
"or switched off fails closed with a sentence. Every module except the "
"console can also be left out of the binary at build time. The released "
"builds are ``default`` and ``shell``. See :doc:`topics/modules`."
msgstr ""
"守护进程的可选部分是模块，各有独立的构建标签和设置。模块可以通过 ``config.json`` 中的 ``without`` 或 ``anet "
"init --without`` 关闭。缺失或被关闭的模块以一句话按失败闭合。除控制台外，每个模块也可以在构建时从二进制中去掉。发布的构建是 "
"``default`` 与 ``shell``。参见 :doc:`topics/modules`\\ 。"

#: ../../news.rst:801
msgid "Command line, MCP and local interfaces"
msgstr "命令行、MCP 与本地接口"

#: ../../news.rst:803
msgid ""
"One output convention: human-readable text by default and ``--json`` for "
"the commands for people; JSON on standard output and readable lines on "
"standard error for task commands. Exit status 3 marks a task that waits "
"for the caller."
msgstr ""
"统一的输出约定：面向人的命令默认输出可读文本，并以 ``--json`` 输出 JSON；任务命令在标准输出输出 "
"JSON，在标准错误输出可读行。退出状态 3 表示任务在等待调用方。"

#: ../../news.rst:806
msgid ""
"New commands: ``anet card``, ``anet task list``, ``anet task watch``, "
"``anet identity ...``, ``anet preview``, ``anet retention``."
msgstr ""
"新增命令：``anet card``\\ 、\\ ``anet task list``\\ 、\\ ``anet task watch``\\ "
"、\\ ``anet identity ...``\\ 、\\ ``anet preview``\\ 、\\ ``anet "
"retention``\\ 。"

#: ../../news.rst:808
msgid ""
"The commands ``find``, ``delegate`` and ``message`` use the same paths as"
" MCP and the local A2A interface and show the same projection of a task."
msgstr ""
"命令 ``find``\\ 、\\ ``delegate`` 和 ``message`` 与 MCP 及本地 A2A "
"接口使用相同的路径，并显示任务的同一投影。"

#: ../../news.rst:810
msgid ""
"Removed commands answer with ``cli_removed`` and the replacement. See "
":doc:`reference/cli`."
msgstr "已移除的命令以 ``cli_removed`` 应答并给出替代命令。参见 :doc:`reference/cli`\\ 。"

#: ../../news.rst:811
msgid ""
"MCP has 14 tools. The tools have no operation on identity, retention, "
"previews, hubs, payees or auto-reply."
msgstr "MCP 提供 14 个工具。这些工具不提供对身份、保留期、预览、Hub、收款方或自动应答的操作。"

#: ../../news.rst:813
msgid ""
"Status: ``anet status`` prints a summary with a line for identity, hub, "
"delivery, inbound, sandbox, payments, privacy and preview."
msgstr "状态：``anet status`` 输出摘要，其中分别列出身份、Hub、送达、入站、沙箱、支付、隐私和预览各一行。"

#: ../../news.rst:815
msgid ""
"Reason codes: one table of codes and sentences in English and Chinese. "
"See :doc:`reference/reason-codes`."
msgstr "原因码：一张包含中英文原因码与语句的表。参见 :doc:`reference/reason-codes`\\ 。"

#: ../../news.rst:819
msgid "Removed"
msgstr "已移除"

#: ../../news.rst:821
msgid ""
"The hub gateway ``/x402/resource``, vouchers and the redemption of "
"vouchers."
msgstr "Hub 网关 ``/x402/resource``\\ 、凭证及凭证兑换。"

#: ../../news.rst:822
msgid "Invitation secrets and the options ``--token`` and ``--token-file``."
msgstr "邀请密钥以及选项 ``--token`` 和 ``--token-file``\\ 。"

#: ../../news.rst:823
msgid ""
"Public prices, the extension ``anet-pricing/v1`` and ``profile set "
"--pricing``."
msgstr "公开价格、扩展 ``anet-pricing/v1`` 以及 ``profile set --pricing``\\ 。"

#: ../../news.rst:824
msgid "The shared task board of the hub."
msgstr "Hub 的共享任务板。"

#: ../../news.rst:825
msgid ""
"The routes that look up keys, key histories and cards by AID; the lookup "
"of direct addresses."
msgstr "按 AID 查找密钥、密钥历史和卡片的路由，以及对直连地址的查找。"

#: ../../news.rst:826
msgid "The configuration keys listed in :ref:`reference-config-removed`."
msgstr ":ref:`reference-config-removed` 中列出的配置键。"

#: ../../news.rst:831
msgid ""
"The documentation is built with Sphinx and published in English and "
"Chinese. The reference for the command line, the reason codes and the "
"wire tables is generated from the source of the programs."
msgstr "文档使用 Sphinx 构建，以英文和中文发布。命令行、原因码和线路表的参考部分由程序源码生成。"

#: ../../news.rst:836
msgid "Known limitations"
msgstr "已知限制"

#: ../../news.rst:838
msgid ""
"What a hub can see, the bounds of forward secrecy and the cases that "
"identity keys do not cover are stated in :doc:`reference/security`. "
"Several items are planned for later releases and are not part of 0.3.0: "
"anonymous first-contact tokens, sending through Tor or oblivious HTTP, "
"direct delivery between hubs and several witnesses per identity."
msgstr ""
"Hub 可见的内容、前向保密的边界以及身份密钥未覆盖的情形，见 :doc:`reference/security`\\ "
"。以下几项计划在后续版本中提供，不属于 0.3.0：匿名首次联系令牌、经 Tor 或不经意 HTTP 发送、Hub "
"之间的直接投递，以及每个身份多个见证。"

